      "message": "I don\u0027t think the mRawOffloadPacket can be used to reply two different {QNAMES,QTYPES}. It basically only contains the PTR, SRV, TXT, A/AAAA record for single {QNAME, QTYPE}. If there are two different {QNAME, QTYPE} pair, it will be two different mRawOffloadPacket. We are not plan to merge two mRawOffloadPacket into one to make it contains multiple QNAME, QTYPE record.",
